       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     TARIBAOVR.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, LLC - DAN RAUCH

      *****************************************************************
      **                    T A R I B A O V R
      *****   -------------------------------------------------
      **   READ OVERRIDE FILE AND RESTORE PREFERRENCE OVERRIDES
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   SEPT  15 2003      DAN RAUCH
      *   INITIAL AUTHOR   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
                                                                       *
      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *================================================================

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

      *=== CATALOG FILE BY KEY - MANF\MANF PART\VNDR\VNDPART\AUXID     ====
           SELECT CATALOG-FILE       ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2005
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *=== OVERRIDE FILE BY CORPCODE ========= UNIQUE KEY =========    ====
           SELECT OVERRIDE-FILE      ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2702
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *============================================================    ====
       DATA DIVISION.
      *============================================================    ====
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CATALOG-FILE.
       01  CATALOG-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2005.
       COPY DARIBACAT   IN COPYLIB.

       FD  OVERRIDE-FILE.
       01  OVERRIDE-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2702.
       COPY DARIBAOVR   IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

      *****************************************************************
      * FILE STATUS AREA
      *****************************************************************
       COPY FILESTATUS  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DTSPARMS2   IN COPYLIB.
       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-FLDS.
           03  WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE         PIC X(04)     VALUE SPACE.

      *=============================================================== ==
      *===        P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N              == =
      *=============================================================== =
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN   I-O     OVERRIDE-FILE
                          CATALOG-FILE.

           PERFORM 0010-INITIALIZE    THRU 0010-EXIT.

           PERFORM 1000-MAIN-LOGIC    THRU 1000-EXIT
                        UNTIL FS-END-OF-FILE.

           CLOSE          OVERRIDE-FILE
                          CATALOG-FILE.

         0000-PROGRAM-END.
             GOBACK.

      ***************************************************************  *
      * PROGRAM INIT ROUTINE
      ***************************************************************  *
       0010-INITIALIZE.

      *=====================================
      * 1ST READ
      *=====================================
           PERFORM 9000-START-OVERRIDE THRU 9000-START-EXIT.
           PERFORM 9000-READN-OVERRIDE THRU 9000-READN-EXIT.

       0010-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ***************************************************************  **
      * MAIN LOGIC
      ***************************************************************  **
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC.

           MOVE BUF-DARIBOVR     TO BUF-DARIBCAT.

           PERFORM 9001-READK-CATALOG      THRU 9001-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *=====================================
      * CATALOG ITEM HAS BEEN DROPPED - RMV OVERRIDE RECORD
      *=====================================
               PERFORM 9000-DELET-OVERRIDE  THRU 9000-DELET-EXIT
           ELSE
             IF  FS-GOOD-FILE-IO

      *=====================================
      * SAVE REASON CODE & USE CATALOG REC TO REFRESH OVERRIDE REC
      *=====================================
                 MOVE ARIBAOVR-REASON-CODE  TO WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE
                 MOVE BUF-DARIBCAT     TO BUF-DARIBOVR
                 MOVE WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE TO ARIBAOVR-REASON-CODE
      *=====================================
      * CATALOG ITEM IS PREFERRED ITEM BECAUSE OF PRICE THEREFORE
      * OVERRIDE NOT NECESSARY - SO DEACTIVATE OVERRIDE RECORD.
      * DON'T DELETE OVERRIDE REC SINCE A PRICE CHANGE IS POSSIBLE
      * WHICH WOULD REQUIRE "RESTORING" THE OVERRIDE
      *=====================================
                 IF  ARIBACAT-PREF-FLAG = "Y"
                     MOVE "N"        TO ARIBAOVR-ACTIVE-FLAG
                     MOVE SPACE      TO ARIBACAT-OVRD-FLAG
                     MOVE SPACE      TO ARIBACAT-REASON-CODE
                 END-IF

      *=====================================
      * RESTORE THE OVERRIDE ...........
      *      1) UPDATE CATALOG OVERRIDE FLAG = "Y" AND REASON CODE
      *      2) UPDATE OVERRIDE RECORD ACTIVE FLAG = "Y"
      *=====================================
                 IF  ARIBACAT-PREF-FLAG = SPACE
                     MOVE "Y"                  TO ARIBAOVR-ACTIVE-FLAG
                                                  ARIBACAT-OVRD-FLAG
                     MOVE ARIBAOVR-REASON-CODE TO ARIBACAT-REASON-CODE
                 END-IF

             PERFORM 9001-REWRT-CATALOG   THRU 9001-REWRT-EXIT
             PERFORM 9000-REWRT-OVERRIDE  THRU 9000-REWRT-EXIT

             END-IF
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 9000-READN-OVERRIDE THRU 9000-READN-EXIT.

       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.


      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *          ALL DATABASE FILE I-O'S BELOW THIS POINT
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

      *****************************************************************
      **  START OVERRIDE FILE  BY CORPCODE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-START-OVERRIDE.

           INITIALIZE BUF-DARIBOVR.

           START OVERRIDE-FILE
                 KEY IS NOT < EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
           END-START.

       9000-START-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  READ OVERRIDE FILE  NEXT RECORD
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READN-OVERRIDE.

           READ OVERRIDE-FILE  NEXT RECORD
           END-READ.

       9000-READN-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  DELETE OVERRIDE RECORD
      *****************************************************************
       9000-DELET-OVERRIDE.

           DELETE  OVERRIDE-FILE
           END-DELETE.

       9000-DELET-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  REWRITE OVERRIDE FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-REWRT-OVERRIDE.

           REWRITE  OVERRIDE-REC
           END-REWRITE.

       9000-REWRT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  REWRITE CATALOG FILE OUT
      *****************************************************************
       9001-REWRT-CATALOG.

           REWRITE  CATALOG-REC
           END-REWRITE.

       9001-REWRT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  READ CATALOG FILE BY KEY
      *****************************************************************
       9001-READK-CATALOG.

           READ CATALOG-FILE
           END-READ.

       9001-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      **************************************************************   ***
      *            E N D   O F   S O U R C E   C O D E
      **************************************************************   ***
